<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Love is in Christ Jesus our Lord.</l><l>Nothing can separate us, we’re assured;</l><l>In the Son, love insures</l><l>God’s love is secure.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Love was the fountain, love was the root,</l><l>Love was the source before me and you.</l><l>Love eternal never fails,</l><l>Love always prevails.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
